      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Perfect for Toddlers and Active Kids
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        Outdoor shoots are perfect for toddlers, especially when the idea of a
        studio session feels like a challenge. Studio shoots can be tough for
        little ones with short attention spans, but outdoors? That's a whole
        different story. They can run, play, explore, and be themselves, while I
        capture their serious faces, cheeky grins, and every little moment in
        between. The best part is that they'll forget there's a camera around,
        and that's when we get the most authentic shots.
      </p>

