      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Choosing the Perfect Location in London
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-6">
        I work mainly in South-West and Central London, there are so many spots
        like beautiful parks, quiet gardens, and hidden gems. I'm always open to
        new locations. If you have a place in mind, just let me know and we can
        discuss. Exploring new parks is part of the fun, and I love finding the
        perfect backdrop for your family.
      </p>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        If you want to have a look at some amazing spots around London, go check
        out my blog post on <a
          href="https://www.mellsnap.co.uk/blog/best-parks-in-london-for-family-photoshoot/"
          class="hover:text-pink transition-colors underline underline-offset-2"
          >best parks in London for family photoshoot</a
        > and let me know which one you like the most.
      </p>

