      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Don't Worry About the Weather
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        One thing families often worry about is the weather, but I'm here to
        tell you not to stress about it. Cloudy days are actually amazing for
        photography! The light is soft and flattering, which makes for beautiful
        images. We can always reschedule if it's raining heavily, but a few
        rainy-day shots can still be a lot of fun, especially with some cute
        umbrellas in hand.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
