      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        The Perfect Time for Your Outdoor Family Photo Session
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        While golden hour just before sunset offers that magical, soft orange
        glow, the best time for your little ones is when they're well-fed and
        rested, so they're feeling happy and energised. I'm always flexible and
        will work around your family's routine to make sure everyone is
        comfortable. Most of my photo sessions are scheduled in the morning or
        afternoon, avoiding the harsh midday light, so we can get those
        beautiful, natural shots without any fuss.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
